   Notes  : The literal payload is exactly 32_768 'A' octets;
            the resulting file is roughly 33 KB.  Parsers must
            treat any literal length as bounded by config, NOT
            by attribute slot size.
   Expected: reject with E_LITERAL_TOO_LONG; do NOT copy into
             any fixed-size stack/heap slot.
   ============================================================ */
